        "status": "present",
        "value": "Let modulus = k^(n-1). Stack holds (node, digit-that-led-here) starting with (0, -1). While the stack is non-empty: if the top node has an unused edge e, increment used[node] and push ((node*k + e) % modulus, e); otherwise pop and, if its digit is not -1, append it. Reverse the collected digits and prefix n-1 zeros."
      },
